'''Baron von Darkcheat''' is an [[NPC]] [[Card Duelist|card duelist]] featuring as the primary antagonist of the TCG Heroes/[[Baron von Darkcheat]] [[Quests|questline]]. He is primarily at odds with the [[Realmkeepers]] ([[Crackshot]], [[Magetech]], [[Ghostshadow]], and [[Wildclaw]]), [[Madam Zelda]], and the player. The player must choose a “Realmkeeper” Cardie deck in the game to combat him, as he is threatening all of [[Sacred Grove]] with his own evil Mystery Chest Cardie deck. He is also said to have created the [[The Gloamstone|Gloamstone]], a presumably ancient weapon that would further aid in his evil plans.

With their decks, players must win enough games against Baron and his three henchmen to ensure that Baron’s deck loses its power and fades from existence, foiling Baron’s plans to become King of Free Realms and plunge Sacred Grove into darkness.

Similar to the Realmkeepers, there is also an outfit that can be gained by opening a Heroes TCG pack. From the packs, in-game décor such as trophies in the likeness of the Baron could also be obtained. On top of this, the Gloamstone becomes an obtainable hoverboard for players who complete the questline.

